WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.149
Dad: What a beautiful morning.

2
00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:09.817
Look at the sunrise. Rachel:

3
00:00:09.818 --> 00:00:14.288
Wow! That's amazing. Dad:

4
00:00:14.289 --> 00:00:18.836
Do you have your fishing poles?

5
00:00:18.837 --> 00:00:21.808
Ricky: We have them, Dad.

6
00:00:21.809 --> 00:00:26.100
Rachel: Do fish eat worms, Dad?

7
00:00:26.101 --> 00:00:30.491
Dad: Yes, fish love worms, Rachel.

8
00:00:30.492 --> 00:00:36.948
Rachel: Eww, Dad.

9
00:00:36.949 --> 00:00:41.608
Dad: Get a worm, Ricky. Put it on the

10
00:00:41.609 --> 00:00:46.467
hook. Ricky: I don't need worms,

11
00:00:46.468 --> 00:00:49.725
Dad. I'm using marshmallows.

12
00:00:49.726 --> 00:00:57.141
Dad: Ricky, fish don't eat marshmallows.

13
00:00:57.142 --> 00:00:59.891
Ricky: Mine is ready.

14
00:00:59.892 --> 00:01:05.888
Dad: Okay, Ricky. Hold your fishing pole like

15
00:01:05.889 --> 00:01:18.204
this. Swing the hook into the water.

16
00:01:18.205 --> 00:01:23.827
Ricky: Dad! Dad! I've got a bite!

17
00:01:23.828 --> 00:01:27.476
Dad: Good for you. Pull it in.

18
00:01:27.477 --> 00:01:31.148
Ricky: It's too big.

19
00:01:31.149 --> 00:01:34.298
It's too heavy.

20
00:01:34.299 --> 00:01:38.003
Rachel: Hold on tight, Ricky!

21
00:01:38.004 --> 00:01:45.432
Ricky: Ugh! Seaweed!

22
00:01:45.433 --> 00:01:50.100
Dad & Rachel: Ha-ha!

